  "result": "The six-question quiz on O4 is ready: `quizzes/0002.json`, with its key in `keys/0002.json`.\n\n- **Ahead of the lessons:** there is no lesson on workflows versus agents yet, so the quiz checks the objective directly. It is built on the standard distinction that in a workflow the code fixes the path, and in an agent the model chooses its own next step and when to stop. I did not look that up in a source this session.\n- **What it covers:** four multiple-choice and two short-answer items. The first three apply \"who owns the control flow\" to makerspace examples. The last three ask why a fixed workflow costs less, what really separates the two, and which task suits an agent.\n- **Misconception ids:** the wrong options point to M7, M8 and M9, which I added. If M7 to M9 already mean something else in your records, those ids need renaming.\n- **Not done:** I did not update `NOTES.md` or write a learning record, since nothing has been answered yet.\n\nDo you want a short lesson on this objective before Riley takes the quiz?",
